      "title": "Kael 4K - workflow settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Kael T-Pose - 4K\n\nDerived from the installed SeedVR2 7B FP16 - Image to True 4K workflow.\n\n**Input:** 1086 x 1448 transparent PNG.\n**Output:** 3072 x 4096 transparent PNG; original 3:4 aspect ratio, no crop.\n\nJoin Image with Alpha restores the source alpha before resizing. SeedVR2 processes RGB and its post-processing node reattaches the resized original alpha.\n\n**Restoration:** 1 step, CFG 1, Euler/simple, denoise 1, fixed seed 260915, LAB color correction.\n\nComfyUI output: Kael_4K/Kael_T_Pose_4K_SeedVR2_*.png"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Kael T-Pose - 4K\n\nDerived from the installed SeedVR2 7B FP16 - Image to True 4K workflow.\n\n**Input:** 1086 x 1448 transparent PNG.\n**Output:** 3072 x 4096 transparent PNG; original 3:4 aspect ratio, no crop.\n\nJoin Image with Alpha restores the source alpha before resizing. SeedVR2 processes RGB and its post-processing node reattaches the resized original alpha.\n\n**Restoration:** 1 step, CFG 1, Euler/simple, denoise 1, fixed seed 260915, LAB color correction.\n\nComfyUI output: Kael_4K/Kael_T_Pose_4K_SeedVR2_*.png"
      },
      "color": "#22303c",
      "bgcolor": "#101820"
    },
